  "id": "section-525",
  "title": "对大跃进报导的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-102.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>102)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　要实事求是，不要浮夸。要作冷静的促进派，要鼓实劲，不要鼓虚劲，冲天的干劲要与严格的科学的态度相结合。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-101.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-103.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
